Applied after virtiofs-15.1.patch. Its module Makefile omits the generated
vnode_if.h, so the build fails with `'vnode_if.h' file not found`; fusefs's
Makefile lists it first in SRCS, and so does this.

diff --git a/sys/modules/virtiofs/Makefile b/sys/modules/virtiofs/Makefile
--- a/sys/modules/virtiofs/Makefile
+++ b/sys/modules/virtiofs/Makefile
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 .PATH: ${SRCTOP}/sys/fs/fuse

 KMOD=	virtiofs
-SRCS=	virtiofs_vfsops.c
+SRCS=	vnode_if.h virtiofs_vfsops.c

 .include <bsd.kmod.mk>
